# Do not

- Do not build a PHP/Laragon-only solution for the recorder
- Do not store keystrokes, passwords, or WhatsApp/chat content
- Do not add hidden “stealth mode” that hides the agent from the employee
- Do not live-stream full desktop video in v1 (screenshots + events only)
- Do not couple this repo to `cfs-designers` PHP portfolio code
- Do not commit TimesheetV2.exe or employee screenshot samples
- Do not start Phase 2 (payroll, GPS, mobile clock-in) inside Phase 1
